      "label": "emotional instability stereotype",
      "description": "The visual metaphor of the man engulfed in flames, combined with the text 'a fire cracker', expresses a stereotype of emotional instability. The metaphor implies the person is volatile, explosive, and prone to sudden, destructive outbursts, which is a negative judgment about their temperament or behavior.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
