      "description": "The textual element 'a fire cracker' is directly mapped onto the visual entity 'man' who is engulfed in flames. This creates an analogical mapping where the man is being metaphorically equated with a firecracker, implying he is volatile, explosive, and prone to sudden outbursts. The visual of flames reinforces the textual metaphor, establishing a direct and explicit analogical relationship between the text and the visual material.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
